msgctxt "108"
msgid ""
"C'mon Taichi, it's beautiful out. How 'bout you and me head out for a nice "
"relaxin' fish?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "120"
msgid "Nah."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "132"
msgid ""
"Oh... Well it's no fun sittin' in here, right? Let's get you\r\n"
"out in the sun!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "144"
msgid "Just leave me alone!"
msgstr "Lasciami in pace!"

msgctxt "156"
msgid "But..."
msgstr "Ma..."

msgctxt "168"
msgid "You want me to go outside? Fine, then let's wrestle!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "180"
msgid "Oh. Well, uh... Maybe later, okay?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "192"
msgid "Later? More like never!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "204"
msgid ""
"I heard what the doctor was saying! I've got asthma!\r\n"
"I'm gonna die if I keep wrestling!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "216"
msgid ""
"But wrestling's the only thing I wanna do. I wanna go pro\r\n"
"and make tons of money so I can help Morning Glory..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "228"
msgid "It's... It's the only thing I'm good at..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "240"
msgid "Taichi. You just need to find another way."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "252"
msgid "Something other than wrestling, huh..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "264"
msgid "That's not what I mean. Wrestling is your dream, right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "276"
msgid "...Yeah."
msgstr "...Già."

msgctxt "288"
msgid "Then you can't give it up."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "300"
msgid "Huh?"
msgstr "Eh?"

msgctxt "312"
msgid "Don't lose sight of your dream, no matter what."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "324"
msgid "I... don't get it, Uncle Kaz."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "336"
msgid ""
"Look, everyone faces obstacles on their path through life.\r\n"
"It just so happens that the first obstacle you have to face\r\n"
"is this asthma thing."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "348"
msgid ""
"So for now, just be patient. Pushing yourself could make it\r\n"
"far worse, and running yourself into the ground is no better\r\n"
"than abandoning your dream altogether."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "360"
msgid "I..."
msgstr "Io..."

msgctxt "372"
msgid ""
"All you can do now is wait. Stay calm. Start making plans\r\n"
"for when you get better. Understand?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "384"
msgid "...Yeah."
msgstr "...Già."

msgctxt "396"
msgid ""
"And you will get better, I'm sure of it. Then once you do,\r\n"
"it'll be all systems go on the path to your dream."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "408"
msgid ""
"He's right, Taichi! Even if you can't do stuff now, you'll\r\n"
"be back in butt-kickin' action in no time flat!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "420"
msgid ""
"And hey, watchin' other people wrestle's still pretty fun,\r\n"
"right? No better way to study moves, if ya ask me!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "432"
msgid ""
"Wait, that's it! We'll put on a special match for you since\r\n"
"you're sidelined n' all!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "444"
msgid "Ain't that right, Aniki!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "456"
msgid "Uh..."
msgstr "Ehm..."

msgctxt "516"
msgid "So, what's this about a special match?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "528"
msgid ""
"Just think about it, Aniki! You and me puttin' on a masked\r\n"
"wrestling show, just like they do on TV!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "540"
msgid "You... want to wrestle me?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "552"
msgid "For Taichi! I think it'll really lift his spirits."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "564"
msgid "True. Guess it's worth a try."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "576"
msgid ""
"Aw man, he's gonna love it! Me and Mikio'll get started\r\n"
"buildin' the ring right away!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "588"
msgid "A ring? You're really serious about this, huh?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "600"
msgid ""
"'Course I am! No point doin' something if you're gonna do it\r\n"
"half-assed, y'know? Don't worry, we'll handle everything."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "612"
msgid ""
"Oh, and I'll let you know when we're ready. You might wanna\r\n"
"warm up first⑬I got some pretty mean moves!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "624"
msgid "Heh, we'll see about that."
msgstr "Eheh. Vedremo un po'."

